# This repo holds ONLY authored Claude Code content (commands/, skills/, agents/,
# CLAUDE.md, statusline). Never let machine state or secrets in, even by accident.
.DS_Store
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.tmp
*.log

# Belt-and-suspenders: things that live in ~/.claude but must never be committed
settings.local.json
.mcp.json
.credentials*
*secret*
*.key
*.pem
history.jsonl
projects/
sessions/
shell-snapshots/
statsig/
telemetry/
reviews/

# Deliberately local-only: this skill and the reference-doc sections that named
# them describe private job-search / health projects, and this repo is public.
# skills/ is symlinked into ~/.claude as a whole directory, so an untracked skill
# here still loads normally — it just isn't published. Trade-off: a fresh clone on
# a new machine won't have it.
skills/interview-prep/
skills/mock-panel/

# Python bytecode from skill scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Playwright MCP scratch output (screenshots, snapshots, console logs)
.playwright-mcp/

# Trialing untracked before full adoption: the ADHD divergent-ideation skill
# (vendored from UditAkhourii/adhd, MIT). Loads globally via the skills/ symlink
# despite being unpublished. Promote to tracked (PR + adversarial review + doc
# row/card) if the trial earns it; delete the dir and this block if not.
skills/adhd/
.claude/*
# …except project memory: the Agent skills block (mattpocock tracker config)
!.claude/CLAUDE.md

# Matt Pocock's skills — served by the `mattpocock-skills@mattpocock` plugin. The raw
# `npx skills` copies that sat here untracked were retired 2026-09-21 (docs/retired.md).
# One loose copy stays because the plugin's manifest does not register it.
# find-skills is skills.sh's own helper, same treatment.
skills/find-skills/
skills/find-skills
skills/implement-spec/
